{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22671","headline":"赠别宣上人 · 白居易","name":"赠别宣上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上人处世界，清净何所似。\n似彼白莲花，在水不着水。\n性真悟泡幻，行洁离尘滓。\n修道来几时，身心俱到此。\n嗟余牵世网，不得长依止。\n离念与碧云，秋来朝夕起。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22671.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22671","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}